<title>USA: Fine Host names Richard Kerley chairman.</title>
<headline>Fine Host names Richard Kerley chairman.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fine Host Corp said Friday it named Richard Kerley, the current president and chief executive, to the additional post of chairman.</p>
<p>Kerley replaces William Berkley who has resigned from the board. Another board member, Andrew Bursky also resigned, the company said.</p>
<p>To fill the vacated seats, the company named Neal Finnegan and J. Michael Chu to the board.</p>
<p>Berkley said he would continue to be a major shareholder in the contract food service management company.</p>
